{"id":"src/lib/ui/originTint.ts","pkg":"src/lib/ui","kind":"module","lines":45,"commentLines":7,"header":["The OPTIONAL colouring of ticket numbers by origin (step 44c). It is OFF for everybody until a person turns it on; I keep the choice in that person's browser and never show it otherwise. Direct recruit (second digit 9) = indigo with a hollow dot, promotee (any other second digit) = amber with a filled dot. I chose two neutral shades (no good/bad colour like red and green) and a dot whose SHAPE differs, so it does not rest on colour alone. The legend appears only while the switch is on."],"symbols":[{"name":"KEY","kind":"constant","exported":false,"line":10,"sig":"const KEY = \"dsp.originTint\"","type":"","doc":[],"members":[],"items":0,"id":"f9e01f14cd-KEY","usedBy":[]},{"name":"EVENT","kind":"constant","exported":false,"line":11,"sig":"const EVENT = \"dsp-origin-tint\"","type":"","doc":[],"members":[],"items":0,"id":"f9e01f14cd-EVENT","usedBy":[]},{"name":"read","kind":"function","exported":false,"line":13,"async":false,"sig":"const read = (): boolean =>","params":[],"returns":"boolean","doc":[],"paramDocs":{},"returnDoc":"","id":"f9e01f14cd-read","usedBy":[]},{"name":"subscribe","kind":"function","exported":false,"line":20,"async":false,"sig":"const subscribe = (cb: () => void) =>","params":[{"name":"cb","type":"() => void","optional":false,"rest":false,"def":""}],"returns":"","doc":[],"paramDocs":{},"returnDoc":"","id":"f9e01f14cd-subscribe","usedBy":[]},{"name":"useOriginTint","kind":"hook","exported":true,"isDefault":false,"async":false,"line":30,"sig":"export function useOriginTint(): [boolean, (on: boolean) => void]","params":[],"returns":"[boolean, (on: boolean) => void]","generics":"","doc":["Returns [is the tint on, switch it]. Every place that shows a ticket follows the same switch, in this tab and in other tabs."],"paramDocs":{},"returnDoc":"","id":"f9e01f14cd-useOriginTint","usedBy":["src/components/AnswerResult.tsx","src/components/OmnibarModal.ts